{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/Title1.png?t=1741311128\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/5.gif?t=1741311128\" />Party Bots supports up to 100 players in each lobby! Although, the use of powerful gaming computers is recommended in this case! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/Title3.png?t=1741311128\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/CustomizeYourBot.gif?t=1741311128\" />You start as a regular Y-Bot, but you don't have to look like everyone else! Customize your face, color, and hat to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/Title5.png?t=1741311128\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/2.gif?t=1741311128\" />Explosions and lasers can destroy platforms in a dynamic and fun way! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/Title10.png?t=1741311128\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/Items.gif?t=1741311128\" />Party Bots is full of new items to unlock. Are you lucky enough to get a really rare one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/Title9.png?t=1741311128\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/Gamemode.gif?t=1741311128\" />You can take control of game modes yourself and change everything to your liking! Don't like the explosive barrels? Remove them! Want things to happen faster? Speed up the events! Is the game too easy for you? Make it harder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/Title8.png?t=1741311128\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1859860/extras/3.gif?t=1741311128\" />This can save you in the most dangerous situations, or just be fun!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Win!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1859860/f79b9724855e555a79cd801673de8876af9dee25.jpg"},{"name":"Better Luck Next Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1859860/c08763bd93290c33ccec925e3d3f60e0c16bf954.jpg"},{"name":"At least you're on the podium","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1859860/8ec754553054bb4dc8bd11de997fb85c3f6134b2.jpg"},{"name":"Twice in a Row!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1859860/4dd833c7241c776fbdcab684e25d2b08b004e97d.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the hang of it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1859860/f7500c60aef44fa4eead67908dd7165daaed6e60.jpg"},{"name":"Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1859860/3eb625f82b39117dcf462a23d81955084a93a7e2.jpg"},{"name":"Covered in Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1859860/0bed9e6622d720ea2f942496724438389a062302.jpg"},{"name":"How Embarrassing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1859860/5d6dd97462fb01